                    </p>
                    <div class="d-flex justify-content-center gap-3 mt-4 animated slideInUp">
                        <a class="btn btn-lg text-uppercase px-4 py-3" href="#" role="button" style="border: 1px solid #D4AF37; color: #D4AF37; background: transparent;">Crear usuario</a>
                        <a class="btn btn-outline-dark btn-lg text-uppercase px-4 py-3" href="#" role="button">Inicio de sesión</a>
